  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The upload servlet management/upload is functionally part of API-M Lite, but it is not documented as such.  The fix to this bug should ensure it gets documented in the WSDL as well as any human-readable docs that talk about API-M Lite in src/userdocs.  ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "It should also ensure that appropriate TestHTTPStatusCodes tests exist (and pass) to exercise AuthN, AuthZ, and request success/failure conditions.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
