  "description": "<p>The upload servlet management/upload is functionally part of API-M Lite, but it is not documented as such.  The fix to this bug should ensure it gets documented in the WSDL as well as any human-readable docs that talk about API-M Lite in src/userdocs.  </p>\n\n<p>It should also ensure that appropriate TestHTTPStatusCodes tests exist (and pass) to exercise AuthN, AuthZ, and request success/failure conditions.</p>",
